@startuml
!theme plain
title Eval System V2 — System Context (3-Tier + Hardware Layer)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10

actor "Test Engineer\n(Browser User)" as User
actor "Zybo Board\n(eval-agent)"      as Zybo

package "Presentation Layer" {
  component "Frontend SPA\n(React 18 + Vite\nTailwind + Zustand)" as FE
}

package "Application Layer" {
  component "Backend API\n(FastAPI / Python\nSQLAlchemy Async)" as BE
}

package "Data Persistence Layer" {
  database  "PostgreSQL\n(Prod) / SQLite (Dev)\n— metadata —"     as DB
  folder    "Object Storage\nuploads/  storage/\n(VCD, Firmware,\nHDF5 waveforms)" as FS
}

package "Hardware Interface Layer\n(Private Network 192.168.100.0/24)" {
  component "dnsmasq\n(DHCP/DNS\nStatic Lease by MAC)" as DHCP
  component "Zybo Farm\n(Board #1 .. #N)"              as Farm
}

User -down->  FE   : HTTPS (UI)
FE   -right-> BE   : REST (HTTP/JSON)
FE   <-right- BE   : WebSocket\n(real-time updates)
BE   -down->  DB   : SQL (async)
BE   -down->  FS   : Read/Write files\n(file_id -> path)
BE   -down->  DHCP : configure\nstatic leases
BE   <-down-> Farm : Control + Data\n(REST + HTTP Stream)
Zybo -up->    BE   : Phone-Home /\nHeartbeat /\nStream upload

note right of BE
  Core services:
  • Job Orchestrator (FIFO + Priority)
  • Board Manager (locking, state)
  • File Handler (checksum, dedupe)
  • Stream Processor (binary -> HDF5)
  • Notification / WebSocket hub
end note

note bottom of FS
  Hybrid storage:
  • Metadata in DB (file_id is FK)
  • Large blobs (VCD/firmware/HDF5) on disk
end note
@enduml
